msgctxt "64"
msgid ""
"Karaoke always makes me thirsty. Here, take this. Pick me up a can of "
"coffee, will ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid ""
"Huh? You can't get a can of coffee for 100 yen anymore. They usually go for "
"about 120 yen at most convenience stores these days."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid ""
"It's only 97 yen at Don Quijote. They don't call it \"bargain city\" for "
"nothing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid ""
"Wow. They've got a better selection than the convenience stores and their "
"prices are lower? Amazing. So, where is this \"Don Quijote\" place?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"There's one at the corner of Nakamichi and Showa Street. You'll hear the "
"store's theme song blaring through the doorway. You can't miss it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "Got it! Be right back!"
msgstr ""

